{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51609","headline":"谢新恩（六首） 六 · 李煜","name":"谢新恩（六首） 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"冉冉秋[光]（色）留不住，满阶红叶暮。\n又是过重阳，台榭登临处。\n茱萸花坠，紫菊气，飘庭户，[晚]烟笼细[雨]（细）。\n嗈嗈新雁咽寒声，愁恨年年长相似。\n（以上南词本注）（〖1〗据詹安泰《李璟李煜词》校改。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李煜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51609.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51609","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}